    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-call-activity-click/folio-assistant-sci/process/Process_LeanDocsPublish",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#Process",
      "name": "Publish a folio's Lean render with the harness chrome",
      "summary": "Build the visualiser of a folio's declared `lean` directory — the Lake package's doc-gen4 HTML render — and put it inside the folio's built site with the harness navbar and rail.",
      "description": "Build the visualiser of a folio's declared `lean` directory — the Lake package's doc-gen4 HTML render — and put it inside the folio's built site with the harness navbar and rail. Owner, 2026-10-10: \"there should be a lean/ visualizer which is then the lean html render (but wrapped w/ cat-harness navbar chrome/rails)\".\n\nTWO STEPS IN TWO LANES, BECAUSE THEY FAIL DIFFERENTLY. The build is a Lake run over the folio's warm olean cache: expensive, and able to damage the cache it reads (a Lake build over an untraced restore evicts it). The publish is a file pass over the build's output: seconds, and unable to touch the cache. So the build sits with the Lean toolchain and refuses rather than risks; the publish sits with the build pipeline, in the slot where `stage-folio-local.ts` rails the folio's own pages — after the site is built, before the chrome check and deploy.\n\nBOTH ENDS THAT ARE NOT \"READY\" PUBLISH NOTHING. A guard that refused, a build that failed, and a page the rail did not reach are all reported as such, never as a site without Lean docs that looks complete.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "sourcePath": "processes/content/lean-docs-publish.bpmn",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant-sci/blob/main/processes/content/lean-docs-publish.bpmn",
      "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-call-activity-click/assets/img/workflows/lean-docs-publish.svg",
      "startNode": [
        "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-call-activity-click/folio-assistant-sci/process/Process_LeanDocsPublish/node/Start_Changed"
      ],
      "nodeCount": 8,
      "flowCount": 7,
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-call-activity-click/folio-assistant-sci/directory/sci-processes",
      "alternateOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/folio-assistant-sci/process/Process_LeanDocsPublish"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-call-activity-click/folio-assistant-sci/process/Process_LeanDocsPublish#flow/Flow_0",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#SequenceFlow",
