      "description": "This instance's own reader-facing pages: the guide to writing a paper, which documents this instance's own process (`processes/content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn`). Moved here from the harness below on 2026-10-23 (wrong-direction move M7). Composed THROUGH just-the-docs (`composed: true`, as the content core's own docs directory is), so its pages land in the platform's site under this instance's name with the sidebar, search and layout. `docs.json` here declares the `docs-source` the platform's one docs-page run reads (owner ruling A1, 2026-10-23): each `source/<group>-<slug>/` renders into `<group>/<slug>.md` beside it, and `compose-docs` leaves `source/` itself out.",
