      "description": "The QA checkers this instance's Lean tooling provides, one folio-qa-checker/v1 node per criterion, naming COST_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS in pipeline/qa-checkers-cost.ts (bean riit, step 3b), and the maths checkers moved here from cat-harness-tools (bean saqd): VACUITY_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS (Lean vacuity, four criteria), RENDER_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS (render-math-mode-envelope), TRIVIALITY_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS (proof-not-machine-trivial), EXTENDED_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS (the paper proof-*, canonical-* and compute-* criteria), USES_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS (uses-formal-coverage, lean-ref-owns-decl), Q_USAGE_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS in pipeline/qa-checkers-q-usage.ts (the seven q-usage-* criteria, run on their own by pipeline/q-usage-audit.ts) and WALL_AUTOMATED_CHECKERS in pipeline/qa-checkers-wall.ts (framework-canonical and the §7c archimedean wall: wall-side-correct, wall-base-ring-minimal). Registered for a folio by loadContributions through its dependency tree; they replace the qaCheckers array contributions.ts returned.",
