      ],
      "description": "Tests that hold the harness's code against what this instance owns or contributes: its paper processes and decision tables, its pipeline plugins and contributed checkers. The code under test is imported down from cat-harness. Also the Lean cache service and its tests: `lake-cache.sh` (the `lean-cache` tool), `reseed-lean-cache.sh`, `lake-cache-fetch.sh`, `lake-cache-produce.py`, `lake-cache-fetch-multi.py` and their `.bat` entry points, moved here from cat-harness-tools `scripts/` (folio-assistant#2598; owner 2026-10-23, \"C ok\"): only a Lean folio runs them, and the `lake-cache` kind is this layer's. The cache branch family they read and write keeps its name, `cat/folio-assistant-sci/lake-cache/<pkg>` (owner, 2026-10-02).",
