      "description": "The judgement half of this instance's QA verdicts, kept on main by owner ruling D2 (a), 2026-10-01 (bean `2gst`): the `pair_attestations` that were carried inside its `kg-qa/v1` sidecars (all `by: baseline` at migration, which the owner ruled are judgements), one `qa-attestations/v1` file per subject at `kg-qa/<mirrored subject path>.attestations.json`. Schema: cat-harness `schemas/qa-attestations.ts`. dependents: reproduce, for the reason the `qa` entry gives. Declared WITH its files, per bean dh4f.",
